# Implementation plan — Spec 1.14.1

## Summary

Replace the **inline unit `<Select>`** on Data **Create / Edit attribute** with a **common unit selection dialog** matching **tag selection**: `UnitPickerPanel`, `UnitSelectField` (trigger + stacked dialogs), `/embed/dialogs/units/select` peer-dialog body, optional nested **Create unit**. Backend `unit_id` contract unchanged.

See [02-unit-select-dialog.md](./02-unit-select-dialog.md), [03-attribute-form-unit-field.md](./03-attribute-form-unit-field.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.14.1` |
| Prerequisite | Tag select pattern (`TagSelectField`, `TagSelectEmbedPage`); Units CRUD + `/embed/dialogs/units/create`; Attribute form with `unitId` |
| Services | Data FE only |
| New env | None |

