## Phase 1 — Unit select module

**Goal:** Reusable picker + embed route.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Panel | `data/frontend/src/features/units/components/UnitPickerPanel.tsx` |
| Field helpers | `data/frontend/src/features/units/components/UnitSelectField.tsx` |
| Embed page | `data/frontend/src/features/units/pages/UnitSelectEmbedPage.tsx` |
| Router | `data/frontend/src/app/router.tsx` → `/embed/dialogs/units/select` |
| Create payload | Ensure `UnitFormDialog` / embed complete includes `symbol` for auto-select |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w data-root`

## Phase 2 — Attribute form

**Goal:** Wire Unit field to picker; remove inline Select + bulk list load.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Form | `data/frontend/src/features/attributes/components/AttributeFormDialog.tsx` |
| Schema | Keep `attributeSchemas.ts`; messages only if needed |
| Edit hydrate | Resolve `{ name, symbol }` for existing `unitId` |

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w data-root`

## Forbidden

- Local unit picker `CustomDialog` when `parentOrigin` is set
- Footer actions in `/embed/dialogs/units/select` body
- Using `/embed/dialogs/catalog/units/select` for attributes
- Backend / migration changes unless create-complete payload truly lacks `symbol` (prefer FE mapping from existing response)
- Editing `webonone-v2/` for this dialog (host already allowlists embed dialogs)

## Done when

- [ ] Number attribute Unit field opens tag-style select dialog
- [ ] Standalone stacked + embed nested both work
- [ ] Selected row has border + Check
- [ ] Create-from-picker auto-selects new unit
- [ ] type-check data-root passes
